28:{"text":"\"It was our brand positioning work that really made everything click. KOTA were empathetic, patient, flexible, quick, and, most importantly, incredibly talented with brand positioning, visual identity, and digital experiences. I've already recommended them twice!\"","backgroundColor":"#c4b5f3","name":"Shanice Daeche","speciality":"CMO","button":"$29","logo":"$2a"}
2c:{"text":"\"KOTA helped us achieve our vision. Through creative idea generation, hands-on guidance and support, to professional project management, they were able to deliver the type of company website that represents our products and services, and most importantly, our brand. We are more than satisfied with the results.\"","backgroundColor":"#a8e1ec","name":"Robert Baird, Collidr","speciality":"View our work","button":null,"logo":null}
2e:{"title":"View our work","url":"/index.htmlwork/","target":""}
30:{"width":241,"height":34}
2f:{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/ISI-Logo-White.svg","mediaDetails":"$30"}
2d:{"text":"“Working with KOTA has been a fantastic experience from start to finish. They partnered with us to design and launch our new brand and website, and the result has exceeded our expectations: modern, confident, and perfectly aligned with who we are as a business.\"","backgroundColor":"#efb2d9","name":"Bianca Cristescu","speciality":"Key Account Director","button":"$2e","logo":"$2f"}
32:{"title":"Work","url":"/index.htmlwork/","target":""}
34:{"width":3000,"height":758}
33:{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-1400x354.png 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-2000x505.png 2000w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-500x126.png 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-768x194.png 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-1536x388.png 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-2048x517.png 2048w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/Ziipline_Logo_Coral_RGB-8-2560x647.png","mediaDetails":"$34"}
31:{"text":"\"After a personal recommendation, we brought KOTA in to evolve our brand from top to bottom. They took the time to understand not just what we did as a company, but the people involved and brought that to life through our updated TOV and a refreshed look that matched the work we've been doing for the last two years. If you want your brand to reflect your ambition, this is the agency to do it”","backgroundColor":"#d7e1d3","name":"Jake Stevens, Ziipline","speciality":"View our work","button":"$32","logo":"$33"}
27:["$28","$2c","$2d","$31"]
