/app/uploads/2025/09/featured-500x281.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/09/featured-768x432.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/09/featured-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/09/featured.jpg 1920w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/09/featured.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1920,"height":1080}},"layout":"fill"}],["$","video",null,{"src":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/09/Featured-compressed.mp4","className":"ProjectCard_video__AheFz","autoPlay":true,"muted":true,"loop":true,"preload":"none","playsInline":true}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedProjects_viewAllLinkMobile__pDKQH","children":["$","$L11",null,{"type":"a-internal","text":"View all projects","color":"white","href":"/work"}]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FaqsList_faqsList__W3Ud0","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_heading__kNT8k","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":"FAQ's"}]}]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How does branding influence online visibility and growth?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Branding shapes how people recognise, trust, and remember you online. A strong brand creates consistency across your website, content, social media, and marketing, helping people understand who you are faster and why they should choose you. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It also impacts performance more directly than people think. Clear positioning improves conversion rates, stronger messaging sharpens marketing, and a distinctive identity makes your brand more memorable in crowded markets.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Can branding affect SEO?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, but not in a “new logo equals better rankings” kind of way. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strong branding supports SEO by making your website clearer, more trusted, and more useful to the people landing on it. Clear positioning helps shape better page structure and messaging. A strong tone of voice makes content more engaging. Consistent brand signals across your website, social channels, PR and wider digital presence can also support recognition and authority over time, leading to LLMs and search engines pulling you into the conversation. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://kota-v2.in-beta.link/blog/seo-in-2025-why-brand-trust-and-off-site-signals-matter/\">Search engines want to serve results people trust.</a> A strong brand helps you become one of them.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"What actually goes into a brand strategy?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Brand strategy is the thinking underneath the visuals. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s the process of defining what makes your business different, who you’re trying to reach, how you should position yourself in the market, and what your audience should associate with your brand. That can include positioning, messaging, audience insights, values, tone of voice, competitive analysis, and your wider brand narrative. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A strong strategy gives every future decision more clarity, from marketing campaigns to website design.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Why is tone of voice so important right now?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because most brands sound interchangeable. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI has made it easier than ever to produce content, but much harder to sound distinctive. A clear tone of voice helps your brand feel recognisable and human across every touchpoint, whether that’s your website, social content, sales decks, or campaigns. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The right tone builds familiarity, trust, and emotional connection over time.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How often should a brand identity evolve?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your brand should evolve when the business outgrows how it currently presents itself. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That could happen because your audience has changed, your positioning has matured, your offering has expanded, or your identity simply no longer reflects the quality of the business behind it. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Not every brand needs a complete rebrand. Sometimes small strategic refinements create the biggest shift.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How do you measure whether branding is working?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Branding affects more than vanity metrics. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can measure its impact through stronger conversion rates, higher-quality leads, improved engagement, increased brand recall, better customer retention, and clearer market perception. Often, teams also feel the difference internally, with sharper messaging, more confidence, and better alignment across sales and marketing. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strong brands reduce hesitation. That’s where the real value starts showing up.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","6",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Do you offer brand strategy before visual identity design?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Always. We believe the strongest creative work comes from clear strategic thinking. Positioning, messaging, audience understanding, and tone of voice help shape identities that feel distinctive for the right reasons, not just visually different. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That’s the difference between decoration and branding.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","7",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Can you evolve an existing brand instead of starting from scratch?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Absolutely. Not every business needs a complete reinvention. Sometimes the strongest move is refining what already works, sharpening the positioning, modernising the identity, and building more consistency across the brand experience. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The goal is clarity, not change for the sake of it.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","8",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How long does a branding project usually take?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A focused identity refresh may move faster, while a full strategy, tone of voice, and visual identity project will naturally take longer. We’ll always map out timelines clearly from the start so there’s transparency around every stage of the process.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","9",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L35",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"What happens after the branding project ends?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We make sure your brand is built to be used properly in the real world. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That usually means online brand guidelines, downloadable assets, practical usage guidance, and support applying the new identity across your website, marketing, campaigns, and digital touchpoints. We can also support with brand-to-build; <a href=\"https://kota-v2.in-beta.link/service/web-design-development/creative-web-design/\">creative website design</a>, <a href=\"https://kota-v2.in-beta.link/service/growth-marketing/seo-and-geo/\">SEO &amp; GEO</a>, content, and ongoing creative rollout.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}]]]}]]}],"$L37","$L38"]}]]
